  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP Implementation: Pewin Supplies Co. Ltd and Seafood Denmark A/S</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme seeks to promote Kenyan and Danish cooperation in commercial fish farming and related ventures. The two companies now have a project in the name of East Africa Fish Co. Ltd which has met the following objectives in the above time frame: Sigma Seafood APS has provided most of the technical support on fish farming techniques, design, farm pond layout, methodology and has sourced quality fish feed from one of the fish feed companies in the world, Aller-Aqua Feeds based also in Denmark. East Africa Fish Limited is now able to provide quality feed of approved standard and at affordable prices to herself and other local farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
